npc_customer_1: Wait, I almost forgot... I came back to grab this energy drink. I would've fallen asleep coding otherwise!
player: Hey, wait. Did you see that? There's someone standing in the corner of the wall outside...
npc_customer_1: Huh? What corner? I don't see anyone there.
npc_customer_1: Are you sure you're not seeing things? You must be exhausted from working the night shift.
player: No, I'm serious! I saw a figure standing right there, watching us...
npc_customer_1: Come on, there's nothing there. You're giving me the creeps. I'm going home, see ya!
